---
title: "Agent chat turn"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Prepare
    lg1: Recall
    lg2: Run
    lg3: Save
    lg4: Stopped
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 purple
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 yellow
  class lg4 pink
  s0: Reading the history
  s1: Checking the question
  s2: Refused: 503 ai_unavailable
  s3: Refused: 404 conversation_not_found
  s4: Recalling memories and picking the tier
  s5: Refused: 422 input_too_long
  s6: Model writing the answer
  s7: Failed: error event, nothing saved
  s8: Answer ready
  s9: Answer rejected, text reset
  s10: Tools running
  s11: Saving the exchange
  s12: Done sent, memory learns in the background
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: history read: Redis hit, else the database
  s0 --> s2: no chat model is configured
  s0 --> s3: the conversation is another owner's
  s1 --> s4: the question passes, secrets redacted
  s1 --> s5: the question is too long
  s4 --> s6: memories added, or none [off, empty, or failed]
  s6 --> s7: timeout, limit, provider error, or app disconnects
  s6 --> s8: the answer passes the screen
  s6 --> s9: the screen rejects the answer
  s6 --> s10: the model calls tools
  s8 --> s11: the rest of the text is sent
  s9 --> s6: the model writes again
  s9 --> s7: timeout, limit, provider error, or app disconnects
  s10 --> s6: the tools return
  s10 --> s7: timeout, limit, provider error, or app disconnects
  s10 --> s8: only screen buttons are called
  s11 --> s7: the save fails
  s11 --> s12: the exchange is saved
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 pink
  class s3 pink
  class s4 purple
  class s5 pink
  class s6 teal
  class s7 pink
  class s8 teal
  class s9 teal
  class s10 teal
  class s11 yellow
  class s12 yellow
